<title>UK: Police find suspect device at Luton airport.</title>
<headline>Police find suspect device at Luton airport.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Police said a suspect device has been discovered in the terminal of Luton airport. Bomb squad officers have been called in to handle it.</p>
<p>Earlier, two bombs blew up next to a major motorway in central England in what appeared to be the latest Irish guerrilla attempt to disrupt the election campaign.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
